&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Manager, 3P Revenue Accounting &amp;amp; Reporting to join our Accounting team. You will own revenue recognition, month-end close and reporting for Claude sold through our cloud service provider (CSP) channels: AWS Bedrock, Google Cloud Vertex AI and Microsoft Azure Marketplace. These channels are among the fastest-growing revenue streams at the company. They run on consumption-based, partner-reported data that changes every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the accounting point of contact for the finance and partner teams at AWS, Google and Microsoft. Internally, you will partner with Finance, FAB, Engineering and business teams to turn partner billing feeds into accurate, auditable revenue. You will also lead the automation of a close that is still heavily manual. If you want to build the financial infrastructure behind a fast-growing AI company, come join us in our mission to build safe, beneficial AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the revenue close for cloud service provider Marketplace within a listed company timeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and review revenue, revenue-share, reserve journal entries, accruals and true-ups including memos for accounting assessments and judgments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own balance sheet reconciliations, reserves, and the usage-to-invoice-to-cash bridge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform monthly and quarterly flux analysis and prepare flux decks for leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own quarter-end deliverables, including footnote disclosures, flux commentary and presentations to leadership and Corporate Accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the primary contact for external auditors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review the work of accountants and contractors, set the close calendar, and keep close packages complete and audit-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own monthly and quarterly 3P revenue reporting for leadership and FP&amp;amp;A, by partner, model, product, region and customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review partner usage, invoice, disbursement and fraud reports each month, and resolve data issues before close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
